{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-126",
  "title": "Content submission pain points",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Content submission pain points"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **manual form review** – parsing submissions, checking nexudus for member status, manually updating spreadsheets."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **scattered file handling** – files come from links, direct uploads, external servers, and they all require manual downloading, verification, conversion, and transfer."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **file conversion & quality checks** – multiple steps, with failure points at every stage."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **scheduling & metadata entry** – everything is hand-entered into cablecast, including things like show titles, producer names, and air dates."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **communication overhead** – confirmation emails, cc-ing team members, and tracking programming decisions."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}